# Theme Overview Rules

## Quick Facts
- **Theme Type**: Full Site Editing (FSE) WordPress theme
- **Namespace**: `Chairforce\` for all PHP classes
- **Framework**: WordPress 6.0+ with Gutenberg blocks
- **Build Tool**: @wordpress/scripts (webpack)

## Key Architecture

### Dual Block System
- **ACF Blocks**: Quick setup, PHP-focused, WP-Admin field creation
- **JSX Blocks**: Preferred approach, React-based, modern workflow
- **Auto-Discovery**: Both types auto-register from their directories

### Core Technologies
- **PHP**: Namespaced classes with Composer autoloading
- **JavaScript**: Modern ES6+ with wp-scripts build system
- **Sass**: Modular architecture with breakpoint mixins
- **FSE**: Block templates, template parts, and patterns

## Essential Directories
```
wp-content/themes/chairforce/
├── src/                    # Main assets (Sass, JS)
├── src-jsx-blocks/         # JSX blocks (preferred)
├── src-acf-blocks/         # ACF blocks (quick setup)
├── lib/                    # PHP classes (Chairforce namespace)
├── includes/               # Helper functions and hooks
├── templates/              # FSE block templates
├── parts/                  # FSE template parts
├── patterns/               # Block patterns
├── acf-json/               # ACF field groups (auto-exported)
├── build/                  # Compiled main assets
└── build-jsx-blocks/       # Compiled JSX blocks
```

## Plugin Dependencies
- **Required**: ACF Pro, Blokki
- **Recommended**: WP Grid Builder, Yoast SEO
- **Managed by**: TGMPA (TGM Plugin Activation)

## Development Workflow
```bash
# ⚠️ IMPORTANT: Run these commands in wp-content/themes/chairforce/
cd wp-content/themes/chairforce/

# Start development
npm run dev

# Build for production
npm run build

# Individual builds
npm run start:assets    # Main assets only
npm run start:blocks    # JSX blocks only
```

## Key Concepts
- **Graceful Degradation**: Works without plugins
- **WordPress Standards**: Leverages core blocks
- **Performance First**: Optimized builds and lazy loading
- **Security**: SVG sanitization, nonce protection
- **Accessibility**: WCAG compliance built-in

